rem Counting Block Combinations I
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=114
rem Count the ways to fill a row with
rem red blocks of a minimum length, any
rem two separated by a black square

use sequences
use io
use cli

option Size integer = 50
option Min integer = 3

rem Ways[n]: the first square is black,
rem or a red block of length L starts,
rem then a black square and any fill of
rem the rest, or the block ends the row.
Ways = array shape (Size + 1) fill 1
for N in Min to Size
  Pre = (Ways take (N - Min)) sum
  Ways N = Ways (N - 1) + 1 + Pre
end
Answer = Ways Size
Answer print
